WEBVTT

1
00:00:09.545 --> 00:00:15.493
Jason was walking to Kids Central with Bobby.

2
00:00:15.494 --> 00:00:18.204
"Nice pajamas," he said.

3
00:00:18.205 --> 00:00:22.412
Bobby laughed. "I like your bathrobe!"

4
00:00:22.413 --> 00:00:26.664
It was pajama day at school, so everyone was wearing pajamas.

5
00:00:26.665 --> 00:00:32.766
"I wonder what Mr. Dunn's pajamas will look like," Bobby said.

6
00:00:32.767 --> 00:00:36.641
The boys entered the gym. "Mr. Dunn said—"

7
00:00:36.642 --> 00:00:43.140
Bobby halted. "Miss Shelly! You're back!"

8
00:00:43.141 --> 00:00:45.387
"Of course, I'm back.

9
00:00:45.388 --> 00:00:49.739
I couldn't miss Pajama Day," Miss Shelly said.

10
00:00:49.740 --> 00:00:54.009
Nina hugged their teacher. "We missed you!"

11
00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:57.312
"What are we doing today?" Ethan asked.

12
00:00:57.313 --> 00:01:00.915
"Making breakfast, of course," Miss Shelly said.

13
00:01:00.916 --> 00:01:05.992
"We can make egg sandwiches or waffles. Your choice."

14
00:01:05.993 --> 00:01:10.941
Jason had an idea. "Can we make both?" he asked.

15
00:01:10.942 --> 00:01:14.299
"That's a lot of food," Miss Shelly said.

16
00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.626
"I mean, can we combine them?" Jason asked.

17
00:01:18.627 --> 00:01:21.634
"How?" Nina asked.

18
00:01:21.635 --> 00:01:25.030
"I saw it on a cooking show," Jason said.

19
00:01:25.031 --> 00:01:27.171
"The chef made egg and cheese sandwiches.

20
00:01:27.172 --> 00:01:31.934
But instead of using a frying pan, she used a waffle maker."

21
00:01:31.935 --> 00:01:35.323
"Let's do it!" Ethan said.

22
00:01:35.324 --> 00:01:39.620
"Can you show us how to make them, Jason?" Miss Shelly asked.

23
00:01:39.621 --> 00:01:42.932
"Sure," Jason said.

24
00:01:42.933 --> 00:01:46.754
Everyone put on their aprons, and Jason took charge.

25
00:01:46.755 --> 00:01:51.150
"Nina, can you please spray oil on both sides of the waffle maker?

26
00:01:51.151 --> 00:01:54.070
Then turn it on medium-high heat."

27
00:01:54.071 --> 00:01:56.424
"Got it!" Nina said.

28
00:01:56.425 --> 00:02:00.261
"Ethan and Bobby, can you crack some eggs?" Jason asked.

29
00:02:00.262 --> 00:02:03.976
"We need four eggs."

30
00:02:03.977 --> 00:02:09.115
Bobby began cracking eggs into a bowl.

31
00:02:09.116 --> 00:02:12.858
Ethan beat them with a whisk.

32
00:02:12.859 --> 00:02:16.792
"Jason, what should I do?" Izzie asked.

33
00:02:16.793 --> 00:02:23.667
"You can measure the shredded cheese."

34
00:02:23.668 --> 00:02:26.748
Jason put the frying pan on the stove.

35
00:02:26.749 --> 00:02:30.676
He turned on the heat and melted butter.

36
00:02:30.677 --> 00:02:35.769
When the pan was hot, he poured the eggs into the pan.

37
00:02:35.770 --> 00:02:37.822
Then he picked up a spatula.

38
00:02:37.823 --> 00:02:41.816
"Now I gently scramble them." Jason looked at Miss Shelly.

39
00:02:41.817 --> 00:02:43.872
"I have a job for you, Miss Shelly.

40
00:02:43.873 --> 00:02:48.770
Can you please put a slice of bread in each square of the waffle maker?"

41
00:02:48.771 --> 00:02:54.523
"Sure." She carefully placed the bread.

42
00:02:54.524 --> 00:02:59.667
Jason sprinkled shredded cheese on each slice.

43
00:02:59.668 --> 00:03:03.288
"Nina, can you add slices of ham?"

44
00:03:03.289 --> 00:03:07.108
Nina laid one slice of ham on each slice of bread.

45
00:03:07.109 --> 00:03:10.184
"Now we add the eggs," Jason said.

46
00:03:10.185 --> 00:03:19.121
"I can do that!" Bobby said.

47
00:03:19.122 --> 00:03:22.092
"The last part is fun," Jason said.

48
00:03:22.093 --> 00:03:27.713
"We put another slice of bread on top and gently close the lid."

49
00:03:27.714 --> 00:03:33.366
"At home we only make waffles in our waffle maker," Nina said.

50
00:03:33.367 --> 00:03:37.220
"You can make these sandwiches in a frying pan," Jason said.

51
00:03:37.221 --> 00:03:42.227
"But it's much more fun to use a waffle maker."

52
00:03:42.228 --> 00:03:45.409
Four minutes later he opened the waffle maker.

53
00:03:45.410 --> 00:03:50.712
"Perfect!" he said. "The sandwiches are golden brown."

54
00:03:50.713 --> 00:03:54.678
"They look just like waffles," Nina said.

55
00:03:54.679 --> 00:03:57.270
"Great job, Jason!"

56
00:03:57.271 --> 00:04:02.671
Miss Shelly lifted the sandwiches out.

57
00:04:02.672 --> 00:04:07.962
She cut them, and everyone had a piece.

58
00:04:07.963 --> 00:04:12.306
"Yum!" Ethan said. "What should we call them?"

59
00:04:12.307 --> 00:04:15.025
"Egg Waffles?" Izzie said.

60
00:04:15.026 --> 00:04:20.773
"Nope," Bobby replied. "The Chef Jason Special!"

61
00:04:20.774 --> 00:04:24.688
"Yes!" everyone said.

62
00:04:24.689 --> 00:04:30.156
Chef Jason grinned and took a bow.
